OL,3,APM believes Brexit vote was legitimate
OL,4,Adespite Russia claims, No 10 says
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham believes the 2016 Brexit
OL,7,Freferendum result was "legitimate",
OL,8,FDowning Street has said, after the
OL,9,Fprime minister claimed there was
OL,10,FRussian interference in the vote.
OL,12,FIt is "inconceivable" that Russia did
OL,13,Fnot try to use the referendum to its
OL,14,Fadvantage, a No 10 spokesman said, but
OL,15,Fthe PM believed it did not succeed in
OL,16,Finfluencing the result.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
